      "command": "C:\\Users\\<you>\\bin\\engram.exe",
      "args": ["mcp"]
    }
  }
}
```

**3. Skills are already configured:**

The skills are linked in `.claude/skills/` for Claude Code, `.cursor/skills/` for Cursor, and `.copilot/skills/` for VS Code.

